BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Mindful Eating Online Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=Europe/London:20260905T103000
DTEND;TZID=Europe/London:20260905T130000
UID:07efedffb4560a8b4ef067c7@lbc-ics
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a practical and nourishing online workshop explori
 ng what it really means to eat mindfully — to slow down\, pay attention
 \, and experience food through all of our senses. Together we’ll take ti
 me to notice the many sensations involved in hunger\, eating\, and satisfa
 ction\, and explore how mindful awareness can transform the way we relate 
 to food.
URL:https://www.londonbuddhistcentre.com/whats-on/mindful-eating-online-wo
 rkshop-5-sep-26
END:VEVENT
